{
  "version": 1,
  "_notes": [
    "The gem store (2026-11-05, Terrence). Items are heroes or dice skins.",
    "price: {currency, amount}; no price means owned from the start.",
    "A currency with open false cannot be earned yet: its items show a lock.",
    "When an area or grade starts awarding a currency, set open to true here.",
    "Gem prices (2026-11-06, Terrence: chests give 1, rarely 2; two more Lava items):",
    "a cleared Acorn crossing banks about 6 gems (5 chests, each 1, or 2 one time",
    "in 6; restarts give nothing, opened chests stay empty), plus a 10 gem bucket for",
    "beating the Skeleton Dragon. Red Bolt 10 (about 2 crossings), Green Bolt 15",
    "(about 3), Sir Blob 25 (about 4). Bolt's other colors (black, purple, pink) wait",
    "for later currencies. A paint recolors Bolt's sprite in code (game/ui/look.gd).",
    "Phase 0 (2026-11-16): every world pays its own currency. A currency's",
    "world is where its chests and its boss's bucket pay it (Store.currency_of_world);",
    "the Lava Caves pay gems. Crystals, Brooches (the Bog), Leaves and Feathers are",
    "open. Shelly (a bog turtle) and the Night dice moved to Brooches, with new Moss dice.",
    "Phase 6 (2026-11-28): the never-earnable Sprout and Sapling stars are gone. A hero",
    "with reward: {level_pass: N} is not bought: it is the child's the first time every",
    "world is beaten at Level N (Store.grant_level_rewards), on the store's Level tab.",
    "Level 1 Leo, 2 Sir Tam, 3 Blaze, 4 to 6 Bolt painted black, purple and pink.",
    "The gold dice moved to gems (30, a bit over Sir Blob), the purple gem dice to",
    "crystals (30, between the Steel and Blue gem dice)."
  ],
